title: "Land-Cover Composite Map of Pamfila, Lesvos: Cartographic Synthesis of UAV Multispectral, nDSM and Thermal Data"
abstract: "Interactive cartographic land-cover composite (elevation / 7-class classification / thermal) over Pamfila, Lesvos, with a Python rendering pipeline. MSc thesis deliverable, University of the Aegean (Department of Geography, RSGIS Lab), Mytilene, Greece, 2026; supervised by Dr. Christos Vasilakos."
